  children: [Pt("Addendum I prepared May 8, 2026. All citations verified against live indexed sources at the time of preparation. Sections identified as proposed mechanisms have no peer-reviewed experimental precedent and are presented as novel speculative architecture requiring empirical validation before clinical consideration. This addendum is licensed under CC BY 4.0, consistent with the parent document.", { italics: true, size: 20 })],
